              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "वो बाजार सूं आयो। — vo bājār sū̃ āyo. — He came from the market.",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: **वो बाजार सूं आयो।** — *vo bājār sū̃ āyo.* — He came from the market.]"
