      "title": "उठ्यो, बैठ्यो — got up, sat down",
      "headword": "उठ्यो · बैठ्यो",
      "romanization": "uṭhyo · baiṭhyo",
      "gloss": "got up, sat down: the past of a stem that ends in a consonant",
      "script": "devanagari",
      "modality": "voice",
      "derivedModality": "voice",
      "modalityReasons": [
        "no-visual-dependency"
      ],
      "sourceHash": "fnv1a64:6b54cd79f2393667",
      "notice": null,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "type": "warmup",
          "title": "Warm-up",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Say to get up, to sit and to walk: उठणो, बैठणो, चालणो. Then Ram came yesterday."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "grammar",
          "title": "Grammar Lens: -यो on a consonant stem",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A stem that ends in a consonant takes -्यो in the past: उठ, उठ्यो; बैठ, बैठ्यो; चाल, चाल्यो; पूग, पूग्यो."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "हूं दिनूगै उठ्यो। hū̃ dinūgai uṭhyo. — I got up early in the morning."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "For a woman it is -ी, and for more than one -्या:"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "मां दिनूगै उठी। mā̃ dinūgai uṭhī. — Mother got up early in the morning."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सगळा बैठ्या। sagḷā baiṭhyā. — Everyone sat down."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "CDIAL lists Old Marwari ūṭhyo, \"stood up\" (CDIAL 1907)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 1,
              "perItem": false,
