              "source": "[YOU SAY: **वो कोनी उठ्यो।** — *vo konī uṭhyo.* — He didn't get up.]"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "recall",
          "title": "Wrap-up Recall",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 3,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "He got up? (उठ्यो.) She got up? (उठी.) They sat down? (बैठ्या.)"
            },
            {
              "kind": "activity",
              "scored": true,
